#: ../../learn/providers.rst:33
msgid "The adapter normalizes messages, tools, and events, not the capabilities of every model. Pick an endpoint and model that support your workflow. In particular, images, visible reasoning, hosted tools, and tool search are not available on every endpoint. This runtime does not expose a general ``response_format`` or structured-final-output setting; for validated data, use a typed tool or validate the final answer in your application."
msgstr "适配器负责统一消息、工具和事件，但不统一每个模型的能力。请选择与你的工作流相匹配的端点和模型。尤其是，图像、可见推理、托管工具和工具搜索并非在所有端点上可用。本运行时不提供通用的 ``response_format`` 或结构化最终输出设置；如果需要经过校验的数据，请使用带类型的工具，或在应用中校验最终答案。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:41
msgid "Configure your chosen provider"
msgstr "配置你选定的模型提供商"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:43
msgid "Read credentials and model names from your environment. Every tab creates a ``model`` you can pass to ``create_agent``; close it with ``await model.aclose()`` when finished. These snippets configure real services and are not offline examples."
msgstr "从环境变量中读取凭据和模型名称。每个标签页都会创建一个可传给 ``create_agent`` 的 ``model``；使用完毕后用 ``await model.aclose()`` 关闭它。这些代码片段配置的是真实服务，并非离线示例。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst
msgid "OpenAI"
msgstr "OpenAI"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:63
msgid "``response=True`` selects the Responses API. Omit it for Chat Completions (the default). Choose a protocol supported by your endpoint; enabling this flag does not add Responses support to a gateway."
msgstr "``response=True`` 会选择 Responses API。省略它则使用 Chat Completions（默认）。请选择端点支持的协议；启用这个标志并不会给网关增加 Responses 支持。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst
msgid "Anthropic"
msgstr "Anthropic"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:79
msgid "Uses the Messages API. ``response=True`` is not supported."
msgstr "使用 Messages API。不支持 ``response=True``\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst
msgid "Google"
msgstr "Google"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:93
msgid "Uses Google GenAI with an API key. ``base_url`` points it at a proxy or a local test server. The built-in constructor does not expose Vertex AI project/location configuration."
msgstr "使用 API 密钥访问 Google GenAI。\\ ``base_url`` 可以把它指向代理或本地测试服务器。内置构造函数不提供 Vertex AI 项目/位置配置。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst
msgid "DeepSeek"
msgstr "DeepSeek"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:109
msgid "Uses Chat Completions by default. ``response=True`` selects a Responses-compatible endpoint when your service supports it."
msgstr "默认使用 Chat Completions。当你的服务支持时，``response=True`` 会选择兼容 Responses 的端点。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst
msgid "Ollama"
msgstr "Ollama"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:124
msgid "Start Ollama and install the selected model separately. Construction does not start a server or download a model. No API key is required for a local service; this adapter uses Ollama's chat protocol only."
msgstr "请单独启动 Ollama 并安装所选模型。构造适配器不会启动服务器，也不会下载模型。本地服务无需 API 密钥；此适配器只使用 Ollama 的 chat 协议。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:129
msgid "A complete tool-calling request"
msgstr "一次完整的工具调用请求"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:131
msgid "This program makes a real network request and may incur charges. Export the variables in your shell rather than pasting keys into source or logs. The program registers an addition tool, streams the response, and closes the provider even if the request fails."
msgstr "这个程序会发起真实的网络请求，可能产生费用。请在 shell 中导出环境变量，不要把密钥粘贴到源码或日志里。程序会注册一个加法工具、流式输出响应，并在请求失败时也关闭模型提供商。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:140
msgid ":download:`Download real_provider.py <../_examples/real_provider.py>`."
msgstr ":download:`下载 real_provider.py <../_examples/real_provider.py>`\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:148
msgid "From an installed package, download the file and run ``python real_provider.py``. The exact wording and whether the model obeys the tool request depend on the selected model. To verify the same tool round trip deterministically, run :doc:`../examples/streaming-tools`."
msgstr "如果使用已安装的包，请下载该文件并运行 ``python real_provider.py``\\ 。具体措辞以及模型是否遵循工具请求，取决于所选的模型。要确定性地验证相同的工具往返，请运行 :doc:`../examples/streaming-tools`\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:154
msgid "Connect a compatible gateway"
msgstr "连接兼容的网关"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:156
msgid "Use ``base_url`` for a service implementing an existing protocol instead of writing a new adapter:"
msgstr "对于实现了现有协议的服务，请使用 ``base_url``，而不必编写新的适配器："

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:168
msgid "The URL is the API root, for example a service's ``.../v1``, not its ``.../chat/completions`` route. Match the protocol to the gateway. Some gateways reject optional fields such as ``prompt_cache_key`` or particular reasoning levels; configure only supported options and test your combination. The adapter does not auto-detect model capabilities from an endpoint URL."
msgstr "URL 应指向 API 根路径，例如服务的 ``.../v1``，而不是它的 ``.../chat/completions`` 路由。请让协议与网关匹配。有些网关会拒绝可选字段，比如 ``prompt_cache_key`` 或某些推理级别；请只配置受支持的选项，并测试你的组合。适配器不会从端点 URL 自动探测模型能力。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:175
msgid "Send extra headers, query parameters, or body fields"
msgstr "发送额外的请求头、查询参数或请求体字段"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:177
msgid "Gateways often route, bill, or version on something the adapters do not model. Every adapter accepts ``extra_headers``; the OpenAI-style and Anthropic adapters also take ``extra_query`` and ``extra_body``, Google takes ``extra_body`` and ``base_url``, and Ollama takes ``extra_query``."
msgstr "网关常常依据适配器没有建模的信息来路由、计费或区分版本。每个适配器都接受 ``extra_headers``；OpenAI 风格的适配器和 Anthropic 适配器还接受 ``extra_query`` 和 ``extra_body``，Google 接受 ``extra_body`` 和 ``base_url``，Ollama 接受 ``extra_query``\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:193
msgid "Headers and query parameters go on every request after the adapter's own, so one given here replaces the SDK default of the same name (use it for ``User-Agent`` or an ``anthropic-beta`` flag). ``extra_body`` is merged into the request body last: it adds options the adapter does not model and may also override ones it does, such as DeepSeek's ``thinking``. The values are copied and validated when the provider is built, and ``extra_body`` must be JSON."
msgstr "请求头和查询参数会附加在适配器自身的参数之后，用于每一个请求，因此这里给出的同名参数会替换 SDK 的默认值（可用于 ``User-Agent`` 或 ``anthropic-beta`` 标志）。\\ ``extra_body`` 最后才合并进请求体：它可以添加适配器没有建模的选项，也可以覆盖适配器已有的选项，例如 DeepSeek 的 ``thinking``\\ 。这些值会在构造提供商时被复制并校验，且 ``extra_body`` 必须是 JSON。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:201
msgid "Reasoning effort"
msgstr "推理强度"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:203
msgid "Set a provider-neutral level on the run instead of vendor-specific options:"
msgstr "在运行上设置与提供商无关的级别，而不是使用厂商专属选项："

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:215
msgid "Level"
msgstr "级别"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:216
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:217
msgid "``MINIMAL``"
msgstr "``MINIMAL``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:218
msgid "Request a minimal reasoning budget when the model supports it."
msgstr "在模型支持时请求最小的推理预算。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:219
msgid "``LOW`` / ``MEDIUM``"
msgstr "``LOW`` / ``MEDIUM``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:220
msgid "Lower or moderate effort; ``MEDIUM`` is the runtime default."
msgstr "较低的或中等的强度；``MEDIUM`` 是运行时默认值。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:221
msgid "``HIGH`` / ``XHIGH``"
msgstr "``HIGH`` / ``XHIGH``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:222
msgid "Request more effort for difficult multi-step tasks."
msgstr "对于困难的多步骤任务请求更高的强度。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:223
msgid "``MAX`` / ``ULTRA``"
msgstr "``MAX`` / ``ULTRA``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:224
msgid "Highest requested levels; an adapter may map them to the same supported setting."
msgstr "请求的最高级别；适配器可能将它们映射到同一个受支持的设置。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:225
msgid "``OFF``"
msgstr "``OFF``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:226
msgid "Omit or disable explicit reasoning configuration according to the adapter."
msgstr "根据适配器的不同，省略或禁用显式的推理配置。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:228
msgid "The current Responses adapter maps ``XHIGH``, ``MAX``, and ``ULTRA`` to ``high``. Budget-based adapters also group the highest levels. OpenAI Chat Completions forwards named levels, so a model that rejects one can still raise an endpoint error. The runtime does not negotiate supported levels."
msgstr "当前的 Responses 适配器会把 ``XHIGH``、``MAX`` 和 ``ULTRA`` 映射为 ``high``\\ 。基于预算的适配器也会把最高几个级别归为一组。OpenAI Chat Completions 会原样转发具名级别，因此如果模型拒绝其中某个级别，仍可能抛出端点错误。运行时不会就支持的级别进行协商。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:233
msgid "``OFF`` is not a universal guarantee of zero reasoning: OpenAI adapters omit explicit effort configuration, while some other adapters disable thinking. The endpoint's default may still reason. Raising the level never guarantees visible reasoning text, a better answer, or a particular price. Set a default for the whole agent with ``create_agent(model, reasoning_effort=...)`` and override it per request."
msgstr "``OFF`` 并不是零推理的通用保证：OpenAI 适配器会省略显式强度配置，而其他一些适配器则关闭思考。端点的默认设置仍可能进行推理。提高级别绝不保证出现可见的推理文本、更好的答案或特定的价格。可以用 ``create_agent(model, reasoning_effort=...)`` 为整个智能体设置默认值，并按请求覆盖它。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:241
msgid "Retries and proxies"
msgstr "重试与代理"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:243
msgid "``RetryOptions`` retries only *before* the first streamed event, so a failure halfway through an answer never replays visible text or tool fragments."
msgstr "``RetryOptions`` 只在第一个流式事件\\ *之前*\\ 重试，因此答案进行到一半时发生的失败绝不会重放已经可见的文本或工具片段。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:254
msgid "Default transports honor ``HTTP_PROXY``, ``HTTPS_PROXY``, ``ALL_PROXY``, and ``NO_PROXY``. Pass your own transport when you need custom routing."
msgstr "默认传输会遵循 ``HTTP_PROXY``、``HTTPS_PROXY``、``ALL_PROXY`` 和 ``NO_PROXY``\\ 。当你需要自定义路由时，请传入自己的传输。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:257
msgid "``max_retries=3`` permits up to four transport attempts: the initial one plus three retries. Authentication and validation failures are not blindly retried. The policy belongs to the model adapter, not ``create_agent``. For a total request deadline, see :doc:`application`. A silent provider is bounded by the timeouts in the next section, and a timeout is not retried."
msgstr "``max_retries=3`` 最多允许四次传输尝试：一次初始请求加三次重试。认证和校验失败不会被盲目重试。该策略属于模型适配器，而不是 ``create_agent``\\ 。如需整个请求的总截止时间，请参阅 :doc:`application`\\ 。静默的提供方由下一节的超时限制，而且超时不会重试。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:266
msgid "When the provider goes quiet"
msgstr "当提供方不再响应"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:268
msgid "A provider that takes the request and never answers used to be waited on for ten minutes, and then asked three more times; the Google and Ollama adapters waited forever. Every adapter now gives up, and says which wait ran out. :class:`~zett_agent.model.TimeoutOptions` has one limit for each stretch where nothing may arrive:"
msgstr "以前，如果提供方收下请求之后一直不回应，会被等待十分钟，然后再被请求三次；Google 和 Ollama 适配器则会永远等下去。现在每个适配器都会放弃，并说明是哪一段等待超时了。\\ :class:`~zett_agent.model.TimeoutOptions` 为每个“不会有任何数据到达”的阶段各设置了一个限制："

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:278
msgid "Limit"
msgstr "限制项"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:279
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:280
msgid "What it bounds"
msgstr "限制的是什么"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:281
msgid "``connect``"
msgstr "``connect``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:282
msgid "5 s"
msgstr "5 秒"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:283
msgid "Opening the connection. A reachable host answers in milliseconds."
msgstr "建立连接。可以访问的主机会在几毫秒内应答。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:284
msgid "``first_byte``"
msgstr "``first_byte``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:285
msgid "60 s"
msgstr "60 秒"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:286
msgid "From sending the request to receiving the response *headers*. Streaming APIs answer the headers before the model has produced anything, so a long wait here means a gateway that took the request and did nothing."
msgstr "从发出请求到收到响应*头*。流式 API 会在模型产出任何内容之前就返回响应头，所以这里等了很久，说明有网关收下了请求却什么也没做。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:289
msgid "``idle``"
msgstr "``idle``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:290
msgid "600 s"
msgstr "600 秒"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:291
msgid "The longest gap between two chunks once the response has started. It is long because a reasoning model may think silently."
msgstr "响应开始之后，两个数据块之间允许的最长间隔。它设得很长，因为推理模型可能会安静地思考。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:304
msgid "There is deliberately no limit on the *total* time: a long answer that keeps streaming is healthy. Set a limit to ``None`` to switch it off. A limit that runs out raises :class:`~zett_agent.providers.base.ProviderTimeoutError`, whose ``phase`` is ``\"connect\"``, ``\"first_byte\"`` or ``\"idle\"``."
msgstr "我们刻意不限制*总*时长：持续流出的长回答是正常的。把某个限制设为 ``None`` 即可关闭它。某个限制耗尽时会抛出 :class:`~zett_agent.providers.base.ProviderTimeoutError`，其 ``phase`` 为 ``\"connect\"``、``\"first_byte\"`` 或 ``\"idle\"``\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:309
msgid "A timeout is **not retried**, except for a failed connection. Retrying a silent provider waits the whole limit a second time, and the first request may still be running, and billed, on the other side. If the response had already started when it went quiet, what arrived was delivered, so a UI has shown it; the request then fails rather than restarting."
msgstr "超时\\ **不会重试**，连接失败除外。重试一个静默的提供方，要把整个限制时间再等一遍，而且第一次请求可能仍在对方那里运行并计费。如果响应已经开始后才安静下来，已经到达的内容会被送达，所以界面上已经显示了；此时请求会失败，而不是重新开始。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:316
msgid "The Google and Ollama clients send their request when the first chunk is asked for, so for them ``first_byte`` covers connecting, the response headers and the first chunk, and the connection has no limit of its own. Ollama's default allows ten minutes for that first chunk, because a local model may need to be loaded from disk first."
msgstr "Google 和 Ollama 的客户端要等到被索取第一个数据块时才发出请求，所以对它们来说，``first_byte`` 涵盖连接、响应头和第一个数据块，连接本身没有单独的限制。Ollama 的默认值给第一个数据块留了十分钟，因为本地模型可能需要先从磁盘加载。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:323
msgid "When the provider answers with a web page"
msgstr "当提供方回答的是一个网页"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:325
msgid "Between you and a provider there is often a reverse proxy, a gateway, a firewall or a captive portal. When that fails it answers with an HTML page, a bare line of text, or nothing, and a failure used to be reduced to \"Provider stream request failed\". The status, the provider's own explanation, and the fact that it was a web page are now in the message:"
msgstr "在你和提供方之间，往往还有反向代理、网关、防火墙或强制门户。它出故障时，会返回 HTML 页面、一行纯文本或者什么都没有，而这类失败以前都会被简化成“Provider stream request failed”。现在，状态码、提供方自己的解释，以及它是一个网页这件事，都会写进错误信息："

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:338
msgid "Failures arrive as :class:`~zett_agent.providers.base.ProviderHTTPError`, which has ``status_code``, ``reason`` (the provider's own words, when the body was a JSON error), ``preview`` and ``is_html``. A rejected credential is still a :class:`~zett_agent.providers.base.ProviderAuthError`, with the same detail added. The SDK's own error stays on ``__cause__``."
msgstr "失败会以 :class:`~zett_agent.providers.base.ProviderHTTPError` 的形式到达，它带有 ``status_code``、``reason``\\ （当响应体是 JSON 错误时，提供方自己的话）、``preview`` 和 ``is_html``\\ 。被拒绝的凭据仍然是 :class:`~zett_agent.providers.base.ProviderAuthError`，并附上同样的细节。SDK 自己的错误保留在 ``__cause__`` 上。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:344
msgid "A streaming request that is answered with a web page or with JSON is an error too, whatever the status. A ``200`` with a login page, or with JSON because the gateway does not stream, used to be read as a successful reply with no text; it is now raised, naming the content type and what the body said. Any other content type is read as a stream, because some gateways send one as ``text/plain``, and a stream that ends without a single event is raised as an error."
msgstr "对流式请求，只要回答的是网页或 JSON，无论状态码是什么，也都算错误。以前，带登录页的 ``200``，或者因为网关不支持流式而返回的 JSON，会被当作一次没有文本的成功回复；现在它们会被抛出，并指出内容类型和响应体说了什么。其他任何内容类型都按流来读取，因为有些网关会把流以 ``text/plain`` 发送；一个流如果连一个事件都没有就结束，会作为错误抛出。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:352
msgid "Streams that end early or carry broken tool calls"
msgstr "提前结束或携带损坏工具调用的流"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:354
msgid "Providers keep a request alive through three failures that used to end it."
msgstr "过去有三种失败会让请求终止，现在模型提供商会让请求在这些失败中继续。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:356
msgid "**Malformed or truncated tool arguments.** If a tool call's JSON is invalid, for example because the response hit its output limit or a gateway cut the stream, the call is not run. It becomes a failed tool result that says what happened and how to retry, so the model can resend a smaller call. Slightly malformed but complete JSON is still repaired silently. A cut-off payload is never completed by guesswork, because that could write truncated content. ``AnthropicProvider(max_tokens=...)`` sets the per-response output budget (default 16384); raise it for large writes, or lower it for a model with a smaller limit."
msgstr "**格式错误或被截断的工具参数。** 如果工具调用的 JSON 无效，例如响应达到了输出上限或网关截断了流，这次调用就不会执行。它会变成一条失败的工具结果，说明发生了什么以及如何重试，这样模型就可以重新发送一个更小的调用。轻微格式错误但完整的 JSON 仍会被静默修复。被截断的载荷绝不会靠猜测补全，因为那样可能写入被截断的内容。\\ ``AnthropicProvider(max_tokens=...)`` 设置每次响应的输出预算（默认 16384）；写入量大时可调高，模型上限较小时可调低。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:365
msgid "**Responses ``error`` events.** A mid-stream ``error`` event (rate limit, overload) is raised with its own code and message instead of surfacing as a missing terminal response."
msgstr "**Responses 的 ``error`` 事件。** 流中途出现的 ``error`` 事件（限流、过载）会带着自己的代码和消息抛出，而不会表现为缺少终止响应。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:368
msgid "**Responses streams without a terminal event.** If a gateway drops ``response.completed`` after every output item finished, the finished items are used and ``finish_reason`` is ``\"incomplete\"``. If an item never finished, or nothing arrived, the stream raised ``ProviderResponseError``; an empty stream is retried because nothing had been shown yet."
msgstr "**没有终止事件的 Responses 流。** 如果网关在每个输出项都完成之后丢弃了 ``response.completed``，那么已完成的项会被使用，``finish_reason`` 为 ``\"incomplete\"``\\ 。如果有某个项从未完成，或者什么都没到达，流就会抛出 ``ProviderResponseError``；空流会被重试，因为此时还没有展示任何内容。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:375
msgid "Prompt caching"
msgstr "提示词缓存"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:377
msgid "The runtime derives a prompt-cache key from the session, so every step of one conversation can use the same routing hint on endpoints that support it. Cache reuse and savings remain provider decisions, not runtime guarantees. Set ``cache_key`` on :class:`~zett_agent.agent.AgentRunConfig` to route several conversations onto one prefix, or construct a provider with ``send_prompt_cache_key=False`` when an endpoint rejects the field."
msgstr "运行时从会话派生出提示词缓存键，因此在支持该功能的端点上，同一对话的每一步都可以使用相同的路由提示。缓存复用和节省仍由提供商决定，而不是运行时的保证。在 :class:`~zett_agent.agent.AgentRunConfig` 上设置 ``cache_key``，可以把多个对话路由到同一个前缀；当端点拒绝该字段时，可以用 ``send_prompt_cache_key=False`` 构造提供商。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:384
msgid "OpenAI sends the key by default. DeepSeek omits it by default because its first-party service caches automatically; enable it only for a gateway that expects it. Other adapters may not expose cache routing."
msgstr "OpenAI 默认会发送该键。DeepSeek 默认省略它，因为其自有服务会自动缓存；只有网关需要时才应启用。其他适配器可能不提供缓存路由。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:388
msgid "When a provider reports cache hits, ``ModelUsage.cache_read_tokens`` and ``cache_hit_rate`` expose them. Requests through gateways that translate protocols often omit the breakdown; ``ModelUsage.cache_reported`` is then ``False``, which distinguishes \"unknown\" from a measured 0% miss."
msgstr "当提供商报告缓存命中时，``ModelUsage.cache_read_tokens`` 和 ``cache_hit_rate`` 会将其暴露出来。经过协议转换网关的请求往往会省略明细；此时 ``ModelUsage.cache_reported`` 为 ``False``，从而区分“未知”和实测的 0% 未命中。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:394
msgid "Always release the adapter"
msgstr "始终释放适配器"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:396
msgid "The client does not own a provider you passed in. Close it when the application is done, even if several clients shared it:"
msgstr "客户端并不拥有你传入的提供商。应用结束时请关闭它，即使多个客户端共享同一个提供商："

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:404
msgid "Changing models mid-conversation"
msgstr "对话中途更换模型"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:406
msgid "Pass ``model=other_model`` to ``run`` or ``stream`` to override the default for one request. Ordinary messages and local tools remain provider-neutral, but vision support and hosted tools must still match the new endpoint. Signed reasoning/replay blocks are retained only for the provider/model identity that can consume them; do not treat them as portable instructions."
msgstr "把 ``model=other_model`` 传给 ``run`` 或 ``stream``，即可为单个请求覆盖默认值。普通消息和本地工具仍然与提供商无关，但视觉支持和托管工具必须与新端点匹配。带签名的推理/重放块只保留给能够消费它们的提供商/模型标识；不要把它们当作可移植的指令。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:412
msgid "Next: :doc:`streaming`, or write your own adapter in :doc:`../extending/model-adapter`."
msgstr "下一步：:doc:`streaming`，或者按照 :doc:`../extending/model-adapter`\\ 编写你自己的适配器。"

